	(text "The 100nF cap\nG<->S allows a soft start\nwhich limits inrush to the \n1000uF bulk cap"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 42.418 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "134d81ba-e85f-4b65-9c4f-3d3eabb0b0ab")
	)
	(text "With Ext + Without USB:\n\n3V3 is high, but S3_VBUS os floating.\nThis makes the S3's LDO see a reverse voltage\nwhich would fry it.\nThis diode sets the VBUS = 3.3V so there is almost\nno reverse voltage through it protecting it\n(it has a small body diode)\n\nVith Ext + With USB:\nS3 VBUS is +5V. The diode reverse bias and S3 VBUS 5V \nis isolated so it doesn't try to power the 5V rail from the USB.\n\nVithout Ext + With USB:\n3.3V is driven by the S3's LDO, but the 5V board rail is not powered,\nand the S3 VBUS is not driving anything."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 210.312 123.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "18dbe6e4-6266-4793-8962-21433f40e120")
	)
	(text "Jumper closed:\nThen (No Ext + With USB) \nwill power the peripherals\n\nJumper opened:\nThen (No Ext + With USB) \nwill only power the S3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.434 63.754 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "24a23a8c-a079-4caf-982c-c358e3e9db09")
	)
	(text "VOUT= 1.235 * (1+R_up/R_down)\n\nR_up/R_down needs CAREFUL CALIBRATION\nsuch that the VOUT - Schotktky's Vf = 3.300V\nIt can't go below 3.300V. It can be above, \nbut it's less nice if I hotplug USB.\n\nR_up R_down Vout     3V3_ext_rail\n47k  22k    3.873 V  3.3234 V\n100k 47l    3.862 V  3.3126 V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 222.504 47.244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4f6721a6-8525-4661-9f1a-96d4c1174ce1")
	)
	(text "C_LDO_out needs \nSOME ESR by design\nso the LDO output \ndoesn't oscillate.\n1 ohms should create the \nright ESR, but if it doesn't\ntry in the 0.5-2 Ω range with scope"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.142 92.964 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "665e5d82-2ba7-4eb6-af0f-daccb869a5d2")
	)
	(text "Reverse voltage\nproteccc"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 79.756 18.034 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "adf7e0d6-9b86-417b-abfa-f9287430cf3a")
	)
	(text "Main 3V3 LDO, provides up to 500mA (enough for WiFi)\nBe careful with ADC tempo noise!\nSet to LDO output strictly more than 3.3V\nThe schotky drops 550mV which wins over \nthe 3.3V of the USB.\nWhen externally powered + USB powered, this means the\nUSB power loses and the ext takes over.\n\n~300 µVrms in adjustable voltage"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.514 27.432 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f384c53e-6865-4158-8979-a21e5ebcf917")
	)
	(text "The fuse is not going to be added initially,\nbut to not refab I provision in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.642 7.366 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f6ce76af-a27b-4255-b260-59382a1d8592")
	)
